<title>USA: Fulcrum IPO withdrawn -- underwriter.</title>
<headline>Fulcrum IPO withdrawn -- underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The planned initial public offering in Fulcrum Direct Inc was withdrawn following a company decision, lead underwriter Hambrecht &amp; Quist said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>According to the deal, a total of 2.5 million shares at an estimated price range of $10 to $12 under the symbol on the Nasdaq National Market was expected to trade late this month.</p>
<p>Fulcrum is a direct marketer of proprietary children's apparel brands.</p>
